Type: Package
Package: dwf4r
Title: Unofficial R Interface to the Digilent WaveForms SDK
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Andrey", "Samokhin",
                  email = "andrey.s.samokhin@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0223-6087"))
Description: An independently developed R interface to selected functions of the
    Digilent WaveForms SDK and its DWF library. The current version supports
    only a limited subset of the SDK, focused on signal generation and timing
    control through the Analog Out and Digital Out instruments. The WaveForms
    SDK must be installed separately.
